# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dymola simulation artefacts
# Written into the working directory on every translate/simulate.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dsin.txt
dsfinal.txt
dsfinal.mat
dsres.mat
dsres.sav
dslog.txt
dsmodel.c
dsmodel_fmuconf.h
dsu.txt
dymosim
dymosim.exe
dsbuild.bat
dsbuild.sh
buildlog.txt
*.mof

# Dymola inter-process signalling files
.simulation
request.
status.
success.
failure.
stop

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Simulation results and exported models
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mat
*.fmu
*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Modelica / OpenModelica
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak-mo
*.mo.bak
~*.mo
*.log

# OpenModelica leaves a per-model build directory behind
*.libs
*.makefile
OMEdit/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Verification evidence is deliberately tracked.
# The *.csv and *.log rules above exist to keep Dymola's per-run artefacts out
# of the history. The files under docs/verification/ are the opposite: they are
# the recorded output of checks that were actually executed, and the raw probe
# log proving which parts of the toolchain were absent. They have to survive.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!docs/verification/*.csv
!docs/verification/*.log
